{"id":"90426ebd1dd924ef","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness.md","title":"Arithmetical Completeness of GLB","display":"thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness — Arithmetical Completeness of GLB","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness","aliases":["89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness"],"display":"thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness — Arithmetical Completeness of GLB","depends_on":["[[89-df-glb-logic]]","[[89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness — Arithmetical Completeness of GLB"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fcc108fa2ae7636\" href=\"?note=0fcc108fa2ae7636\" title=\"89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization\">89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0ce064881a79d6f7\" href=\"?note=0ce064881a79d6f7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-soundness\">89-df-arithmetical-soundness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>两个对象可证明性谓词采用上述固定标准表示，非任意外延等价公式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLB}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLB}\\)</span> 为上述双模态定理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^B_r\">\\(\\tau^B_r\\)</span> 为普通及一次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 可证性的翻译。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}glb\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{GLB}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\\n(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\tau^B_r(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}glb\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{GLB}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\\n(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\tau^B_r(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 15 章，印刷页 191–205；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\nDzhaparidze 的定理，原书以 Ignatiev 的简化证明陈述。可靠性分别验证普通/一次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 可证明性的派生条件和两个交互模式；完全性使用辅助逻辑与有限双关系模型构造，再同时对角化产生反解释。该辅助模型不是 GLB 自身的普通 Kripke 框架。这里保存来源支持的定理接口；辅助系统及其 17 个构造引理尚未逐原子展开，不把单模态 Solovay 证明直接改下标当作证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-glb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glb-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization","status":"resolved","id":"0fcc108fa2ae7636","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"0ce064881a79d6f7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau^B_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}glb\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{GLB}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\\n(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\tau^B_r(A)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1686,"backlinks":[{"id":"b7d6bfa12e121880","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5121b107e6141953","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c55a65d7df5b6430","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-193","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-omega-consistency]] → [[89-df-omega-provability]] → [[89-df-bimodal-formula]] → [[89-df-glb-logic]] → [[89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization]] → [[89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness]] → [[89-thm-glb-kripke-incomplete]] → [[89-df-glsb-logic]] → [[89-thm-glsb-truth-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["5a9efa2261b8f73c","0fcc108fa2ae7636","0ce064881a79d6f7"]}